      "trigger": "While wielding the blessed weapon, the current missing rounds across clips in use determine a generic critical-strike-chance stat; reloading or a fully empty clip returns the bonus to zero. No duration, stack buildup or cooldown.",
      "recalculation": "The pre-shot chance applies to the shot; consuming the last round makes the subsequent empty-clip bonus zero. Switching out removes the held-slot stat; switching back recalculates from the current clip state.",
      "critical_scope": "The tier override replaces the entire base conditional-stat table, so the bonus is generic critical_strike_chance rather than an added ranged-only 5%; autogun butt strikes and pistol melee attacks can use it. Phosphor backblast passes is_critical_strike=false.",
      "crit_math": "Generic, attack-type and handling chance are summed and clamped to [0,1]; ordinary chance rounds to two decimals before PRD. Per-round percentage-point increments therefore do not guarantee the same rounded threshold movement at each step.",
